				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>不思議な　気配が　する……！
周囲を　調べますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:53:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
